  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「う～む」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「暇そうなやつが誰もいない。やはり、三年生で進学が目標のひとはみんな勉強をしているようだなあ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「うぅ。教室にも図書室にも自習をする三年生たちが……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「こうなると、いよいよ私が音頭を取るしか……ないのかあ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「生徒会のみんなが匙を投げようとしている、あの『開会式』の仕事を」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「ただでさえお月見のときに、参加者みんなにバニーの衣装を着せちゃったし……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「できることならほとぼりが冷めるまでは、じっとしていたいのだけどなあ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「あっ、下僕くん。ちょうどいいところに！　もしよかったら、私の悩みを聞いてほしいのだあ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「えっ、いま『合唱大会』で助っ人を鍛えるのに忙しいの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「『文化部部長会議』で合唱部が大変なことになっている、と……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「うむ。そのことは私も聞きしに及んでいるぞお？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「いちおう私も文芸部の部長だからなあ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「なんでも、合唱部は『合唱大会』で結果を出さないといけないとか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「そうか。下僕くんはその手伝いで忙しいのだな。感心感心♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「うん。それならしかたがないな。私の悩みなんて合唱部の件に比べたら、『ちっぽけ』なものなのだあ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「ただすこし、人手が足りていないだけというか。ともあれ、下僕くんの手を煩わせるほどの仕事ではない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「行っておいで、下僕くん。私のほうはなんとかなるから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「合唱部の連中が、後悔のないように。全力を尽くして、満足のいく結果が導き出せるように。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「おまえが、陰でサポートしてやるといい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「ん。どうして悲しそうな顔をしてるのだあ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「合唱部の件は、おまえに降りかかって、おまえが納得して引き受けた仕事なのだから……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「私のことを手伝えなかったからといって、申し訳なさそうな顔をしなくて、いいのだあ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「今回はたまたまタイミングが合わなかっただけ。縁が伴っていなかっただけのことだからな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「むぎゅっ!?　こ、こら！　どうして私に抱き着くのだあ!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「こう見えて私は年上だ、愛玩動物ではないぞ、決して！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「……ねぎらいの気持ちは、なんとなく伝わったけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひまり",
    "text": "「ああ。私のほうは心配ないと言っているだろう。だから安心して」"
